 "summary": "The High School (Fa\u00e7ade) in real LEGO parts: a high school's front entrance on a shallow base. At its center, a tall box of pale blue glass in a grid of panes stands on slim columns over an open porch, with three pairs of glass doors, navy banners and trash cans behind. To one side, a block of light gray metal panels and the older school beyond, red-brown brick under a deep band of board-formed concrete; to the other, a low wing with a ribbon of dark windows behind two big shade trees. In front, a wide plaza between curved white curbs, lawns and shrubs, a picnic table, a sign, two light poles with red banners, and six students. Lamps hang inside the glass and over the porch. The back is a plain wall, so it sits neatly on a shelf or against a wall.",
